# Keep the build context to what the image needs. Before 2026-10-18 `COPY . .` baked the nightly
# dumps (backups/, real client data), .env (SECRET_KEY_BASE + DB password), log/, .git and the spec
# suite into every image layer — and every changed dump busted the asset cache.
.git
.gitignore
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
backups/
log/
tmp/
archives/
public/uploads/
node_modules/
spec/
qa/
docs/
coverage/
.seeded
.flavor_seeded*
.flavor_demo_seeded*
docker-compose*.yml
*.md
!README.md
